TEXT -128 -440 Left 2 ;Lab C - condenser microphones 4133 / 4134 driven by an electrostatic actuator (pressure applied straight to the diaphragm: no sound field, no T(s) / Gpb generator)
TEXT -128 -408 Left 2 ;Layout as in the lectures: electrical loop | mechanical loop, acoustic network below. Only fs and Q are typed in; M_AS and R_AS follow inside LTspice.
TEXT -128 -360 Left 2 !.param a=0.004475 x0=2.077e-05 E=200 MMD=1.5e-06 CMD=2e-05 RMD=1e-9 Vb=1.264e-07 RL=1e+10 rho=1.18 c=344.0
TEXT -128 -328 Left 2 !.param SD=pi*a**2 CAB=Vb/(rho*c**2) MA1=0.6133*rho/(pi*a) CMT=1/(1/CMD+SD**2/CAB) CE0=8.854e-12*SD/x0
