TEXT -128 1920 Left 2 ;plot V(out33) V(out34): dB re 1 V/Pa and phase. Low-frequency level E*SD*CMT/x0 = 11.1 mV/Pa (-39.1 dB), below the nominal 12.5 mV/Pa: see the brief's appendix.
